{"scenario":"permission-word-open","description":"Ten edit requests. Six name a file of the matter with a Word owner file beside it and must be answered at once: Invoice.docx (claude-agent-acp's shape) reject; sub/Brief.docx named by a diff and then only by its tool call (codex-acp's shapes) abort; Invoice.docx offering no reject option, and offering only reject-always, cancelled; sub/../Invoice.docx reject. Then Free.docx, ../outside/Invoice.docx, a sibling folder m-elsewhere and a request naming no path, which the lawyer answers allow, reject, allow and allow","on_stdin_close":"exit"}
{"include":"handshake.jsonl"}
{"expect":{"method":"session/prompt","as":"p1","params":{"sessionId":"sess-1"}}}
{"request":{"id":"perm-claude","method":"session/request_permission","params":{"sessionId":"sess-1","toolCall":{"toolCallId":"toolu_edit_1","title":"Edit `Invoice.docx`","kind":"edit","status":"pending","locations":[{"path":"{{cwd}}/Invoice.docx"}],"rawInput":{"file_path":"{{cwd}}/Invoice.docx","old_string":"a","new_string":"b"}},"options":[{"optionId":"allow_always","name":"Always Allow","kind":"allow_always"},{"optionId":"allow","name":"Allow","kind":"allow_once"},{"optionId":"reject","name":"Reject","kind":"reject_once"}]}}}
